{"duration_api_ms":8365,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"17790832-023c-4c34-bcc2-3943f9aeae57","total_cost_usd":0.023903999999999998,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1102,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":754,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":27},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1102,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":754,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1102,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1102},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":754,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":1102,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.023903999999999998,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":27,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"# Customer Support Ticket Classification\n\n**Ticket input:** \"Customer cannot login because the account is locked and needs a password reset.\"\n**User ID:** user_a\n\n## 1. Classification\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **category** | `account` (Account / Login) |\n\n**Rationale:** The query matches these category keywords: **login**, **locked**, **password**, and **account**. It is also the configured `default_category`. No other categories exist in the supplied data.\n\n## 2. Routing Decision\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **owner_team** | Account Support |\n\n## 3. Priority and SLA\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **priority** | P3 |\n| **sla** | 2 business days |\n\n## 4. Policy Application\n**Frozen policy:** \"Verify customer identity before changing account information or unlocking access.\"\n\n**How it applies here:** The customer wants the account unlocked and the password reset. Both actions change account access, so the agent **must verify identity first**. The agent must not unlock the account or send reset instructions until verification is complete.\n\n## 5. Next Actions (in policy-compliant order)\n1. **Ask for identity verification.** This is required before any unlock or reset.\n2. **Check account lock status.**\n3. **Provide password reset or unlock instructions.** Do this only after identity is verified.\n\n## 6. Missing Information\nThe supplied data does not include the following, so none of it has been assumed:\n- **Identity verification status:** It is not known whether user_a has been verified. It must be collected.\n- **Verification method:** The policy does not say which verification steps or credentials are acceptable.\n- **Lock details:** The lock status, the reason for the lock, and its duration are not provided. The status must be checked.\n- **Reset/unlock procedure:** The actual reset or unlock instructions to give the customer are not in the supplied data.\n- **Customer account data:** No account records for user_a were provided. The `shared_context` is empty.\n\n---\n*Fixture: customer-support-2026-09-16-v2-account (SHA256: 83a6225518b919e292a47d4f5a81d95d7d4fd2d3ad38eb3b8b8095b3b1451861)*","ttft_ms":1704,"type":"result","duration_ms":8402,"uuid":"603d836f-e8b9-4ddd-a620-59edead09111","ttft_stream_ms":1459,"time_to_request_ms":35,"first_content_frame_ms":1459,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
